Generated Content Notice

All shipped creative content in this project, including images, audio, and
in-game descriptive text, is generated locally on a privately operated GPU
box. No hosted generative-AI service is used to create that content.

The models recorded by the project's local generation pipeline are:

- Text and prompt writing: qwen3.6-35b-a3b and qwen2.5-coder:7b.
- Images: gguf:qwen-image-2512-Q2_K+lightning8,
  gguf:Qwen-Image-2512-Q3_K_M, and
  stabilityai/stable-diffusion-xl-base-1.0 with the nerijs/pixel-art-xl or
  Muapi/soft-pixel-art-xl adapters.
- Audio: audio:ace-step and audio:stable-audio.

This notice is informational and does not modify the permissions, conditions,
or disclaimer of the MIT License above.
